"is limited by the number of max size dgrams that will fit into the buffer"
" allocated in `alloc_cb`, and `suggested_size` in `alloc_cb` for udp_recv"
" is always set to the size of 1 max size dgram."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/udp.rst:485
